OL,3,ADiabetes and ADHD drugs to be tested on
OL,4,AAlzheimer's patients in new study
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clinical trial has been launched in
OL,7,Fthe UK which scientists hope could cut
OL,8,Fyears from the search for new
OL,9,Ftreatments for Alzheimer's disease.
OL,11,FIt will test multiple drugs
OL,12,Fsimultaneously, starting with two
OL,13,Frepurposed medicines already used to
OL,14,Ftreat type 2 diabetes and attention
OL,15,Fdeficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD).
OL,17,FThe study will examine whether the
OL,18,Fdrugs can lessen symptoms such as
OL,19,Fmemory and thinking problems, and help
OL,20,Fpeople maintain their quality of life.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
